      "message": "test(app): a project saved with each old Agie post name posts the goldens\n\nThe #4022 review found that the legacy-project test only read the\nscript text. The new agie_native::legacy_name test opens the\ncontrol-checked punch saved under each old name, posts it with no\nper-run option override, compares the ISO, SBR and SBL files with the\nunchanged goldens, and checks that a save writes the new name. The\nwire_post_alias round-trip keeps the open and save checks, under a name\nthat no longer says it posts.\n\nRefs #4000\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
